  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert, Rule of Law DG NEAR - National Expert, Rule of Law DG NEAR, AP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert, R&#xe4;ttstatens principer DG NEAR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidra till definitionen av EU:s politik p&#xe5; v&#xe4;stra Balkan i omr&#xe5;det r&#xe4;ttsstat, s&#xe4;kerhet, migration och f&#xf6;rsoning med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; utbyggnaden av den reviderade utvidgningsmetoden inom r&#xe4;ttsstatsomr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the definition of EU policies in Western Balkans in the field of Rule of Law, Security, Migration and Reconciliation with a particular focus on the rollout of the revised enlargement methodology in the field of Rule of Law.</narrative>
  </description>
